title: "Reasoning Post-Training Lab"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research stack for QLoRA supervised fine-tuning and Direct
  Preference Optimization of open-weight language models, with deterministic
  data, matched controls, immutable selection locks, and audit-ready artifacts.
